          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ವಾವಲಂಬನೆ — svāvalambane — \"self-reliance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಳ್ಳಿಯ ಹೆಂಗಸರು ಹೊಲಿಗೆ ಕಲಿತು ಸ್ವಾವಲಂಬನೆ ಸಾಧಿಸಿದರು. haḷḷiya heṅgasaru holige kalitu svāvalambane sādhisidaru. The village women learned tailoring and became self-reliant."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ವ (self) + ಅವಲಂಬನೆ (leaning on)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸ್ವಾವಲಂಬನೆ (svāvalambane) is built from Sanskrit sva, \"self\", and avalambana, \"leaning on, depending upon\" (Monier-Williams): depending on oneself."
            }
